   "texts": [
    "<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>食材：</strong><br /></span>1片纵切 BR&Ouml;DMIX<br /> FLERKORN 面包<br />3片 SJ&Ouml;RAPPORT <br />腌制三文鱼<br />1汤匙奶油芝士<br />半个红苹果，切成小块<br />1茶匙酸豆<br />1茶匙细香葱碎<br />1茶匙莳萝碎</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>烹调</strong><strong>步骤：</strong></span><strong><br />1.</strong>将奶油奶芝士抹在面包上，放上三文鱼。<br /><strong>2.</strong>混合其余食材，撒在三文鱼上。<br /><strong>3.</strong>将三明治横切成5小块，方便食用。</p>"
